{"server":"cn","storyId":"act18d3_level_act18d3_01_beg","groupId":"act18d3","stageId":"act18d3_01","title":"闯入者","storyCode":"SV-1","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b98e77239edc9ba90a970121f68167513b4f27124353b12e810b972bb290d675","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"深夜，斯卡蒂发现医疗舱里的幽灵鲨失踪，而掳走她的正是幽灵鲨以前的队长歌蕾蒂娅。临走之前，歌蕾蒂娅告诉斯卡蒂，接下来她们将前往一座伊比利亚小城。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"沉默。怪异。捉摸不定。外乡人。\n他们自然会这么说。\n阴暗。冷血。见死不救。天生怪物。\n所有人在背后都会这么说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"是啊。\n人只要失去了故乡，就什么都不是了。\n照理来说，来到这里的我，应该能开始一个新的生活。\n只是，过往挥之不去。这些东西会顺着影子爬上你的小腿，把你向泥沼深处拽去。\n我们谁都摆脱不了过往。\n如果有一天，你的故乡找上了你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"2:33 A.M. 天气/阴\n罗德岛本舰，走廊"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦！等这份报告提交完成，你的外勤任务就算结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，又是......空白？咳，咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"从头到尾，只有“完成”两个字啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"任务确实完成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是这样没错......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......你多写两句话也不会有什么问题吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎么办......比想象的还难对付？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（之前没和她说过什么话，这回说是要和她对接，虽然组长提醒过......但果然还是很难办。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的，我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"关于任务中的细节，如果博士有疑问，会再找你确认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，凯尔希医生说你也许不会想向她提交报告......她还说阿米娅对你太温柔了，这样下去是不行的......之类。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"然后就把这次任务归档到博士那边了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"这个女人，哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"那你想直接向博士面呈报告吗？现在博士好像不在，你可以休息几天，等博士回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"现在你提交的这份报告，真的很需要再补充！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"很麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，任务编码F1071，确认提交，后续补充——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"把档案还给我。我想起来，再完善点内容也可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！当然可以！那就麻烦你啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（比预想的要顺利一些啊......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的话，我这边没什么事了，还请回去好好休......嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"你的脸色一下子就变了，发生什么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？在这里？船上吗？难道是入侵者？！听人说你五感特别敏锐，难道是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"不对啊，如果船上有危险，警报会响起来吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......歌声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"歌？什么歌？呃，很安静啊，我没听见......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"这里，为什么会有歌声？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"确实好像有些嗡嗡声，但那也不是歌吧？罗德岛上的各类仪器都还在运转，有可能是，是机械振动？你还没太习惯吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"不，气味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"海水的味道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......斯卡蒂？你有点吓到我了。你在说什......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？喂！斯卡蒂！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂跑得太急、太快，她跑进楼梯通道，她害怕乘电梯几秒间的焦虑就会让那气味溜走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一个猎人走上海岸♪\n她能听到这歌。这艘船上的大多数人，他们听不见。\n这种语言，这种旋律，唤起了她的回忆。她不是个恋旧的人，但她太熟悉了。\n但......不该这样。这首歌不该出现在这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他的家乡在后，徒余哀叹♪\n歌声在这艘船的管道里游移。\n海水的气味从舱壁里不断渗出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂也同样记得这味道。潮湿逼近了她，她的皮肤不住地收缩、绷紧。紧张，却也是激动。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"难道她醒了？她不禁加快了脚步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"幽灵鲨！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"她拉开医疗舱的门。\n床铺是空的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"也有可能是清醒了以后想出去走走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等......这是什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她捡起那个东西，捏了捏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......好像是她的东西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"幽灵鲨的金链被随便地丢在地上。或许是故意的。\n她很讨厌这东西吗？那她肯定是不喜欢现在自己的身份了。\n教会，至少海里教会的所有事，都不是好事。\n但......不对劲。\n外人。\n不知为什么，斯卡蒂突然想起了这个词儿。\n她意识到那其实不是幽灵鲨的气味。\n比起以前的幽灵鲨，现在这气味太浓烈，又太冷酷。斯卡蒂怀疑自己只是被惊喜冲昏了头脑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就在这附近。你是谁？出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"是深海猎人。但不是幽灵鲨。竟然还有其他活下来的深海猎人！\n但为什么在这里？\n......幽灵鲨去哪了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......无论你是谁或者你是什么。出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她得去追。有什么不对劲。她感到对方的确在附近。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂冲出房门，一个身影在走廊深处一闪而过。\n不......有两个人。歌声仍在，对方仍在低吟。\n幽灵鲨。那个深海猎人带走了幽灵鲨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真慢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再不过来，我们可就要走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"猎人！你是谁？"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂一跃，转过角落，她不自主地摸索起身上能用的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"——你在做什么？"},{"type":"narration","text":"那一刻她竟先直视了对方的双眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，你是......"},{"type":"narration","text":"一个自己没有想过的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac18_01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"气色不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......难道是二大队的，幽灵鲨的队长......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......歌蕾蒂娅......？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有些时日了，斯卡蒂。你还能记起阿戈尔的歌，我很欣慰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂没能从她的表情里抠出哪怕一丝丝的“欣慰”。这个女人，从自己知道她开始，表情就从来没变过。\n高挑的女性抱着幽灵鲨。数年来，斯卡蒂唯一知晓还存活的深海猎人，幽灵鲨，现在正靠在歌蕾蒂娅的肩上，做着又一场难得平静的梦。\n在幽灵鲨的队长吐出第一个词的同时，歌声消失了。\n斯卡蒂一阵恍惚。从舷窗涌入、独属陆地的干燥的风拂过斯卡蒂略显干燥的面颊，她心想，这个猎人还活着，歌蕾蒂娅活着。斯卡蒂终于又找到了一个同类。\n不对。是歌蕾蒂娅找到了她们。只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......我以为你死了。你们拼死让我们过去的。我以为你们全死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"生命可贵。很高兴看到你也活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"既然幽灵鲨还活着，我也常在想，你们二队是不是还能有其他人活下来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你是怎么找到这里的？幽灵鲨......她还是呆在病房比较好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂印象里最严厉的猎人之一，在这时选择了一言不发。\n怀疑在斯卡蒂心里滋生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"她变了很多。她现在未必认识你，她的身体也还很虚弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"虚弱？猎人不会虚弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你来陆地上多久了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"地上的病，特殊的病，在掏空她的身体。这艘船上的人能稳定她的病情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"这些年过来，她从来没清醒过。现在的幽灵鲨是另外一个人。我不知道是什么把她变成了这样。"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂娅没说话，微风吹过，歌蕾蒂娅的发丝随之飘荡，掩住了她的眼神。\n斯卡蒂意识到了问题所在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......歌蕾蒂娅。你就是歌蕾蒂娅，我不会认错人。但你要做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你想带她去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我以为猎人在陆地上是自由的。我是不是理解错了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"不，歌蕾蒂娅......她还睡着。她想不想走，你没问过她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你想从这带走她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的这些新同僚，你似乎对他们青睐有加。他们对你是否也一样？你随手就能捏碎他们的脊梁，又怎么能不让他们感到恐惧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"陆地上的这些人对我们有敌意也正常，但这艘船上的不会。我遇到的不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我还没能理解你放松警惕的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"不......这件事我不想他们掺和，问题也不在我身上，不在他们身上。"},{"type":"narration","text":"问题在你。\n斯卡蒂往前走了一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你这么做是什么意思，你最好说明下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"猎人斯卡蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——在陆地上我不用执政官的身份约束你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可我也没有义务向你坦白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只是认为，我应该让你知道，是我带走了她，我自己的队员。这就足够。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今晚的你还不需要知道原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"但是幽灵鲨她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——（伊比利亚语）——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在那个名字完整地传到斯卡蒂耳朵里之前，歌蕾蒂娅就已自舷窗滑进了舰外的月色，幽灵鲨瘫软的身体也随之一起消失了。\n斯卡蒂没有伸手去抓，她动都没动。\n她清楚，歌蕾蒂娅想跑，自己是怎么都追不上的；但如果歌蕾蒂娅只是想跑，那就不会给自己留下讯息。\n她在求助，或者她在诱骗自己。斯卡蒂将信将疑，又别无他法。至少她没命令自己去做什么，别去做什么。\n“盐风城。”\n歌蕾蒂娅是这么说的。\n斯卡蒂她不得不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"盐风城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......这重逢也太不感人了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们在这干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，她是斯卡蒂吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"我是觉得她有点眼熟。和画像有点像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊！哈哈，得来全不费工夫啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"是斯卡蒂没错，我们蹲对地方了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，她真应了......而且你看她那把剑。她真的是斯卡蒂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂，你还记得“上尉”吗？我们拿了他的钱，要给他报仇，要你的命！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"你头壳坏了......你头壳坏了！我就说这是个馊主意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不是说拿了他的钱骗骗人就好吗？！什么报仇啊，什么拿悬赏啊，怎么可能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"你想想那些传闻！真要是她，这趟活儿还能有我们一个子儿吗？命都要赔上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"我看咱们还是趁早散了吧！拿上你的破铜烂铁逃吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"呸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你自个儿爬回到你的烂床上抱着驮兽的尿喊妈妈去吧。一个长头发的年轻姑娘就叫你吓破了胆儿。想让老子无功而返，没门儿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"说得对！就算她真的是斯卡蒂，就算斯卡蒂再怎么厉害，那她现在也只有一个人对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"我们有一、二......呃，好多个！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"可是那些厉害的赏金猎人不都烂在了地里？那时候，她也是一个人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"你再想想，你每次说自己人多的时候，真的会有好事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"有谁看见了？要我说，那几个家伙，说不定是夜里喝高了进了同一个漂亮库兰塔的屋里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"结果人家从裤裆里掏出弩来一阵乱射，把大家的脑袋都给轰烂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"传闻就是那么回事，要是不夸大些，那些抱着琴唱歌的，那什么吟游歌手，他们还能有饭吃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"什么一剑能劈开五十座山啊......老子还能一拳头打穿伦蒂尼姆呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"听我说兄弟们！想吃饭的就跟我一块上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"管她斯卡蒂活卡蒂的，咱搁这儿弄死，之后不怕人抢金子！加上其他人悬赏她脑袋的钱，下半辈子根本不用愁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"给你们个机会。现在跑还来得及，我没时间和你们折腾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"上啊！干死她！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿戈尔语）烂掉的海草最粘人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到，不会变的就只有劣质赏金猎人的麻烦劲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["罗德岛干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
